    applicable stack files. FastAPI, NestJS, Next.js and Tailwind are absent.
  No derived stack is selected, so the Extends column and inheritance rules
    remain absent. Revisit if a derived stack is introduced (#684). Template
    af855c11c4ab0cf50f92e1ffa1da9b330cee3bd6 names that column in
    §Independence and is not taken with it.
  docs/architecture/structures/ supplies alternatives for a structural choice,
    not additional project rules. The domain shape was chosen in #939 and
    recorded as ADR 0023, with its rules in docs/architecture/structure.md;
    the folder itself is not copied, as the template's architecture index
    directs once the choice has landed.
  docs/procedure/ (template 1310e430f2e1172069ec71d3822dbbd2730f3ff6) is not
    taken yet; its adoption is deferred to #1090. The sentence
    1310e430f2e1172069ec71d3822dbbd2730f3ff6 adds to AGENTS.md §What this
    file outranks only places that layer below the conventions, so it is
    left out with the layer (#1091). Template
    8c4c3b8bc5a85b422f2c615eac977d5badd80875,
    fd7ee578fefdb6a07e49b1cac08b8a622ea23996,
    0958721978efe238e2174ba255e9397a7bcd2143 and
    e54a6647cc75e3f2a58143a4e4f6290a52737acb change only that layer and are
